# Base URL of the Directus CMS that feeds the Selected Work grid (#works).
# Local dev: point at a local or the deployed Directus. Prod: set the same value
# as a Coolify build argument (VITE_DIRECTUS_URL) so it's baked into the build.
# Leave empty to fall back to neutral placeholder tiles.
VITE_DIRECTUS_URL=https://cms.darlingdesign.pro
